---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
import { href, REPO_URL, meta } from "../lib/site";
---
<Base title="About LureRadar" description="LureRadar is an independent, open-source, defensive project: explainable detection of hyped-launch scams, free CC0 blocklists, no trackers and no accounts." og="about">
  <PageHeader eyebrow="About" index="ABT" title="Every launch casts" em="a shadow.">
    <p>Every hyped launch brings a wave of fake downloads, “free beta keys”, key generators and phishing pages. LureRadar watches for them, explains every verdict in plain language, and publishes free blocklists so anyone can protect a home network or a company in a minute.</p>
  </PageHeader>
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card"><h2>Principles</h2><ul><li>Explainable by construction: named signals, fixed weights.</li><li>Precision first: keywords alone never flag a site.</li><li>Defensive only: passive analysis, nothing is ever executed.</li><li>Honest claims: “detected” and “likely”, with dates and sources.</li></ul></div>
      <div class="card"><h2>What it is not</h2><ul><li>Not affiliated with any publisher or platform holder.</li><li>Not an AI product: no LLM decides anything.</li><li>No accounts, no servers to trust, no browsing data.</li><li>No warranty: detections may contain false positives.</li></ul></div>
    </div>
    <h2>Open source</h2>
    <p>Code under MIT, feed data under CC0-1.0. Source, issues and roadmap: <a href={REPO_URL}>GitHub</a>. Documentation: <a href={href("docs/")}>docs</a>. Current version: <span class="mono">v{meta.version}</span>.</p>
    <h2>More</h2>
    <p><a href={href("ethics/")}>Ethics &amp; abuse policy</a> · <a href={href("privacy/")}>Privacy</a> · <a href={href("bot/")}>Crawler information</a> · <a href={href("methodology/")}>Methodology</a></p>
    <p class="muted">LureRadar is an independent project, not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Rockstar Games, Take-Two Interactive, or any platform holder. All trademarks belong to their owners. Names are used only to describe the launches and the brands that scammers impersonate.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>.narrow { max-width: 1040px; } .card h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; } .card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; } .card li { padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-2); } p { color: var(--text-2); max-width: 70ch; }</style>
